        "pass_to_pass as ZTEST names, twister_fail_to_pass as twister reports them). Another",
        "selected pair may also be valid, so a different pair is reported, not counted wrong.",
        "`stage` says where the pipeline itself rejects a PR: hard_filter (filter_candidates.py),",
        "dry_run (dry_run.py selects no pair), or triage (only the model can tell). All of",
        "them are still sent to the model, to check it rejects what slips through earlier.",
